  },
  "summary": "Restore the open promotion gate for public adapter documentation.",
  "why": "The prior audit correctly denied a current public adapter but assigned future public exposure to CC-R02. This revision supersedes only that R02-public-exposure wording. CC-R02 may implement and characterize the adapter under research authority; CC-D09/OD-009 still governs promotion, public namespace placement, autodoc, and Sphinx-rendered public documentation."
